      "title": "CMake+GitLab CI: Add ABI checks.",
      "message": "CMake+GitLab CI: Add ABI checks.\n\nAdd {wiretap,epan,wsutil}-abi-dump targets that run abi-dumper on each\nof our main libraries. Add dumps from the current release-4.0 branch.\nAdd an \"ABI Check\" job that runs abi-compliance-checker on a baseline\ndump and a current one.\n\nModified cherry-pick of bed261416d.\n",
